~~> programe  me bahot sare instruction likhe jate he.ye instruction koi bhi programing languageme hote he. computer ko batata he ki kya work karna he.computer sare instruction ko execute karta he or usko machin code me convert karta he.kyunki computer ye language samaj nahi pata. bad me expression karke output genrate karke deta he.

Q3. What is Programming?
~~> computer jo human language nahi janta jese ki hindi,english...
isiliye computer se task karvane ke liye instruction likhne ke liye jo bhi language use ho usko programing language kehte he.programming language  ko me likhe gaye instruction ko easily machin language me convert ho sakte he.

Q4. What are the key steps involved in the programming process?
~~> 1. problem ko samjana (karna kya he)
    2. logic banana (Decide karna konse logic use hoge)
    3. code likhna (instruction dena)
    4. compile (program execute karke Machin code me convert)
    5. Debugging (koi error aye to fix karna)
    6. Run (programe run karvana)

