Q6.World Wide Web & How Internet Works
~~> World wide web jo internet pr available web pages or website ka collection he.
    internet data exchange karta he.
    Work : 1. user browser me website ka url dalta he.
           2. browser request ko server ke pass bhejta he.
           3. seever request pr process karta he.
           4. uske bad clint ko responce bhejta he.
           5. browser webpage display karta he.

LAB 7 :  Research and create a diagram of how data is transmitted from a client to a server over the internet.
~~>    USER -->BROWSER-->IP-->SERVER-->PROCESS-->RESPONCE
     1. User brwser se request send karta he.(url se)
     2. browser pehle DNS se uska IP address find karta he.
     3. bad me request internet throgh sever ke pass jati he.
     4. sever us request pr process karega 
     5. server use request ke sathe responce bhejta he.
     6. user ke brwser me responce display hota he.

