Q35. What are the pros and cons of desktop applications compared to web
applications?
~~> Deskto ke pros :
        offline work kar sakte he.fast execution ,secure data.
    Desktop cons :
        insatall require ,manual update ,platform dependent.

    Web App pros :
        install karne ki jaroorat ,kisi bhi device se acess ho sakte he,auto update.
    Web App cons :
        internet require , performence slow , server down to app nahi chalta .
        

